claimed: intent-module-split — okay-intent, at the consumer request that is the only one of the seven asking for a boundary rather than a type. Thirteen files in okay-agent classify messages and none of them touch the agent loop, so a caller wanting Probe drags in Agent, Provider, Stepper, Durable and Rerun. The consumer whose imports break asked for it explicitly and volunteered to eat the migration.
One factoring makes it clean rather than circular: only Classify reaches into okay-agent, for ToolSpec.jsonSchema, and that is the Schema -> JSON Schema algebra -- the FOURTH algebra over Schema[A] after Json, Cbor and YAML -- which belongs in okay-codec beside the other three. Moved there, okay-intent depends on okay-codec, okay-rag and the core, and not on okay-agent at all.
TOUCHES build.sbt, which this repo flags for coordination, and renames a package other modules import. Announced in the room before starting.
